## Model

- **Primary:** {{PRIMARY_MODEL}}

## Memory layers

| Layer | File | Mutability |
|-------|------|------------|
| IDENTITY | CLAUDE.md, rules.md, USER.md | manual only |
| YELLOW | TOOLS.md | agent on trigger |
| WARM 14d | core/warm/decisions.md | auto-rotate |
| HOT | core/hot/recent.md, handoff.md | auto |
| COLD | core/MEMORY.md, core/LEARNINGS.md | on-demand Read |

**Recall:** `hooks/local-recall.mjs` greps the cold memory on each prompt and injects the top
matches. Keyword-based, no server, no network. Optional semantic recall: `optional/openviking/`
(off by default).

## Skills installed

| Skill | What it does | Key needed |
|-------|--------------|------------|
| onboard | first-run questions: profile, goals, style overrides, services | none |
| superpowers | planning, TDD, debugging, review, brainstorming | none |
| deep-research | multi-source research with citations | none |
| skill-creator | create and improve skills | none |
| groq-voice | voice transcription | Groq key |
| gws | Google Workspace: Gmail, Calendar, Drive, Docs, Sheets | Google OAuth |
| youtube-transcript | YouTube video transcripts | transcript API key |
| markdown-new | clean Markdown from a URL | none |
| quick-reminders | one-off reminders | none |

Skills without their key stay inert and say what to set; nothing else breaks.

